<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>{{title}}</title>
{{!-- Real Google Fonts for vector PDF text. Puppeteer waits for
     networkidle0 in the renderer, so these always finish loading
     before the page is captured. --}}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
{{{designSystemCss}}}
{{{brandVars}}}
{{{templateCss}}}
</style>
</head>
<body class="{{bodyClass}}">

{{> brandBandTop docNumber=docNumber docType=docType}}

<main>
{{{body}}}
</main>

{{!-- Closing colophon — LAST in the document, deliberately.
     This block used to sit here ABOVE <main>, on the theory that
     `position: running(footer)` + `@page { @bottom-center }` would lift it
     into every page's bottom margin. Chromium implements neither, so it
     simply rendered where it was written: once, at the top of page one,
     between the letterhead and the cover. Moving it after <main> makes the
     markup match what actually happens — a seal that closes the document.

     The real per-page footer (brand line, doc number, "Page N of M") is
     Chromium's native footerTemplate, assembled in render-pdf.js.

     D-2.6 adds the social rail so reviewers, prospective buyers, and
     adjusters can one-tap to our Google reviews, site, and social presence.
     The rail is NBD-specific chrome (hardcoded NBD review/site/social URLs),
     so it renders ONLY for the NBD tenant — a stranger tenant must never
     stamp NBD's Google reviews / socials on its customer documents
     (gauntlet de-brand: omit rather than leak). --}}
<div class="doc-band-bottom">
  <div class="seal">{{company.seal}}<br>{{seal}}</div>
  <div class="footer-body">
    <div class="footer-name">{{company.footerName}}</div>
    <div>{{company.footerContact}}</div>
    {{#if docNumber}}<div>{{docType}} · {{docNumber}}</div>{{/if}}
  </div>
  {{#if company.isNbd}}{{> socialRail}}{{/if}}
</div>

</body>
</html>
